<title>CANADA: Maple Leaf Foods Inc Q3 net profit rises.</title>
<headline>Maple Leaf Foods Inc Q3 net profit rises.</headline>
<dateline>TORONTO 1996-11-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996		     1995</p>
<p> Shr	 profit	C$0.15   profit	C$0.12</p>
<p> Net	 profit	13,485   profit	 9,807</p>
<p> Revs		     761,311		  769,625</p>
<p>	   9  MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr	 profit	C$0.29     loss	C$0.65</p>
<p> Net	 profit	26,776     loss	52,716</p>
<p> Revs		   2,268,107		2,295,874</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  92,200		   81,400</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)  </p>
<p>Note: The 1995 pro forma earnings for the nine month period is C$0.20 a share after reflecting the effect of more interest expense, assuming the firm had changed the company's debt structure had occurred at the start of 1995 rather than on April 24, and before unusual items.</p>
<p>-- Reuters Toronto Bureau (416) 941-8100</p>
